{"overview":"همان‌طور که مبارزهٔ آمریکا برای استقلال آغاز می‌شود، یک پسر طبل‌دار جوان، زنی برده و یک خانوادهٔ پاره‌پاره به دنبال آزادی می‌گردند؛ در میان نبرد و فقدان، موسیقی امید را در داستانی عمیق انسانی از ایمان و بخشش به ارمغان می‌آورد.","tagline":"","overview_en":"As America’s fight for independence begins, a young drummer boy, an enslaved woman, and a divided family search for freedom. Through battle and loss, music carries hope in a deeply human story of faith and forgiveness.","tagline_en":"Forgiveness is revolutionary.","runtime":129,"status":"Released","seasons":[],"episodes":null,"crew":["Ben Smallbone","Joel David Smallbone"],"crew_en":[],"countries":["US"],"cast":[{"name":"Joel David Smallbone","role":"Jeremiah Clem","photo":"/jgmSh04jRbSxGlBTMJ9Wo4CFDMB.jpg"},{"name":"Lucas Leach","role":"Benjamin Clem","photo":"/4h5G3kDY41ebZLQ81HBHHPJCIEi.jpg"},{"name":"India Brown","role":"Emmaline","photo":"/hqOxRR0DBJ8Z2IKFYThCV7xcsqv.jpg"},{"name":"Melora Hardin","role":"Rachel Clem","photo":"/ymH5zoBrtEfFWIkgKAhiEbtiAg4.jpg"},{"name":"چارلز استن","role":"Lord Balfour","photo":"/pd5Z0xe1CCRtaprwxdnP1rncNxj.jpg","en":"Charles Esten"},{"name":"ایان گلن","role":"Major John Ambrose","photo":"/d9CKAAiV1HvSnzzmpDzD0mC0HlX.jpg","en":"Iain Glen"},{"name":"ایئون گرافود","role":"Nathaniel Clem","photo":"/h2pg2XwJPcOWotHgiohXjEZUBLa.jpg","en":"Ioan Gruffudd"},{"name":"Beth Easdown","role":"Lady Elizabeth Balfour","photo":"/tVGgLl2xF6FQDTGOx1ymxSoA5L2.jpg"},{"name":"Beverley Knight","role":"Margaret","photo":"/44Lt1tA9y9Pzl8HDK1p2PDykOjz.jpg"},{"name":"Scott Folan","role":"Simon","photo":""},{"name":"Harry Simkins","role":"Joseph","photo":""},{"name":"Jonny Weldon","role":"Sam","photo":"/1dT4DJf0csj2Vut2D94pkVpXRNW.jpg"}],"trailer":"rXaR4nXRvOY","watch":{},"recs":[],"tmdb":"https://www.themoviedb.org/movie/1697911"}